  "description": "Spacious 3-Bedroom Traditional Farmhouse | Ideal Commuter Location\n\nLocated within a 20-minute drive of Derry, Buncrana, and Letterkenny, this spacious traditional three-bedroom farmhouse offers a spacious rural home, perfectly positioned for easy commuting.\n\nWhile situated in a working farmyard, the property benefits from a spacious and secluded back garden area, shielded by mature trees for complete privacy. \n\nKey Features:\n\n3 Bedrooms: Bright, generous living space throughout with plenty of extra rooms.\n\nHeating: Two cozy open fireplaces alongside oil-fired central heating.\n\nOutdoor Space: Spacious, private rear area framed by beautiful surrounding trees.\n\nLocation: Unbeatable central location for commuting, just 20 minutes to Letterkenny, Derry, and Buncrana.\n\nRental Terms:\n\nNo pets allowed.\n\nStrictly no smoking.\n",
